# This repository also hosts a published Maven repository under repo/.
# Store everything byte-for-byte so Gradle-generated checksums stay valid.
* -text

# Exception: the release bookkeeping files must stay LF. A CRLF checkout gives CI a trailing \r
# in the version values, which lands inside mc-publish's file paths and breaks the CurseForge
# and Modrinth steps (the glob "dist/....26091603\r.jar" never matches). tools/release.py also
# writes them with newline="\n".
versions.properties text eol=lf
release-state.properties text eol=lf
